# Never let Cursor (Tab, Chat, Composer, codebase indexing) read or send
# real production secrets as context. Only .env.prod files hold production
# values — .env and .env.local are local/dev-only sample values, and
# .env.example is reference documentation, so both stay visible to Cursor
# (see CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md security rules).
**/.env.prod
**/.env.staging
**/.env.main.prod
**/.env.main.staging
